  "description": "After seven years trapped in the Devil Grand Duke’s dungeon, Luculia is finally free, but her savior is not the prince she imagined. Davierre Montefeltro, a temperamental duke, unexpectedly takes her in. As Luculia adjusts to life outside the dungeon, mysteries swirl around Duke Davierre’s intentions. Can Luculia find happiness at last, or is this new life just another dungeon?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
